{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     topic-icon — a glyph for a tag, inferred from its slug.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Ghost gives a tag a name, a slug, a description and an image — and no
     icon. So a card that wants a glyph has to infer one, and this is the one
     place that inference lives: it is needed by the path card, the track
     card and the course card, and copied three times it would drift the
     first time a topic was added.

     `{{#match slug "~^" "…"}}` is a STARTS-WITH match, so `apex` catches
     `apex`, `apex-masterclass` and `apex-basics` from one branch.

     ⚠ ORDER MATTERS — the more specific prefix goes first, same rule as the
     post dispatcher. And unlike the navigation icons, this one ALWAYS emits
     something: .ns-trackcard__icon is a bordered box, and an empty box reads
     as a broken image rather than as a card without an icon.

     ⚠ EVERY GLYPH HERE MUST BE IN THE SUBSET. assets/css/namaste-ui.css
     carries a Phosphor subset generated from the glyphs the design system
     itself uses — a `ph-` class outside it renders as EMPTY SPACE, with no
     error and no fallback box. ph-user-gear, ph-plugs-connected and
     ph-sliders-horizontal were all written here first and all three were
     blank; they are ph-user, ph-plugs and ph-gear now. Check before adding:

         grep 'ph-your-icon' assets/css/namaste-ui.css
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
{{~#match slug "~^" "admin"~}}<i class="ph ph-user" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "apex"~}}<i class="ph ph-code" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "lwc"~}}<i class="ph ph-brackets-curly" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "flow"~}}<i class="ph ph-flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "integration"~}}<i class="ph ph-plugs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "security"~}}<i class="ph ph-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "data"~}}<i class="ph ph-database" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "start"~}}<i class="ph ph-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "build"~}}<i class="ph ph-cube" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "automate"~}}<i class="ph ph-lightning" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "getting-started"~}}<i class="ph ph-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "config"~}}<i class="ph ph-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else match slug "~^" "trouble"~}}<i class="ph ph-lifebuoy" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~else~}}<i class="ph ph-book-open" aria-hidden="true"></i>
{{~/match~}}
